Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:07.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:11.12,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:21.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:33.52,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:40.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:44.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:47.84,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.69,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:54.04,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:01:00.29,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:03.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.61,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:19.05,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:22.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:43.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.68,0:02:02.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,This restriction... isn't bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.96,0:02:05.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior was saved by Teacher a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.92,0:02:08.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,She taught me alchemy and cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.48,0:02:11.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now that she's in trouble,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.16,0:02:12.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior needs to help her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.39,0:02:24.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,This gate connects to Teacher's secret room.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.20,0:02:25.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,No one knows about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.60,0:02:27.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior will guard you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.04,0:02:29.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,If something is wrong, I will tell Senior.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.68,0:02:40.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.52,0:02:45.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior, are you hurt ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.68,0:02:46.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.04,0:02:48.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,With the talisman,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.66,0:02:51.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,we can borrow the Heaven Stealing Furnace's energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.48,0:02:52.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.96,0:02:54.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Heaven Stealing Furnace
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.48,0:02:57.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,was built by the Founder in the early days of the sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.04,0:02:59.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,For thousands of years,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.15,0:03:01.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,it has accumulated a huge amount of spiritual energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.04,0:03:03.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Each refinement
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.08,0:03:04.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,makes it stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.40,0:03:05.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can say that
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.44,0:03:07.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's stealing the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.52,0:03:09.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now that we also have the talisman,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.44,0:03:11.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,once they start refining a pill
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.24,0:03:13.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,we will use it
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.20,0:03:15.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,to steal their spiritual energy
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.12,0:03:16.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,and open the pill seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.36,0:03:20.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is this furnace also part of the Heaven Stealing Furnace ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.04,0:03:22.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.84,0:03:27.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,I built this pill furnace in secret after studying the main one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.12,0:03:30.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,I was planning to use it as my last trump card.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.40,0:03:34.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,If the Sect were to do something to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.12,0:03:36.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,I would use this furnace
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.16,0:03:38.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,to turn the main furnace to dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.64,0:03:42.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since the Elders would've been busy repairing the furnace,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.00,0:03:45.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,they wouldn't have been able to track me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.96,0:03:48.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,After we undo the pill seal,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.82,0:03:51.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,will the spiritual energy remain in the furnace ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.12,0:03:51.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.44,0:03:55.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then if I cultivate in this furnace,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.72,0:03:57.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,wouldn't it help my breakthrough ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.52,0:04:37.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivators,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.64,0:04:42.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I know that your precious grade 4 pills
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.80,0:04:45.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,were difficult to obtain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.24,0:04:46.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,You cannot bear to part with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.72,0:04:47.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior Ouyang,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.84,0:04:50.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,we don't mind parting with our pills.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.84,0:04:52.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,I just want to ask you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.60,0:04:56.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,if you can guarantee that by sacrificing our grade 4 pills,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.28,0:04:59.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,we will be able to refine a grade 5 pill ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.16,0:05:04.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.96,0:05:06.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,What is there to guarantee ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.04,0:05:08.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Are you worried for my pill !?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.52,0:05:11.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Listen up,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.28,0:05:13.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Pill Sacrifice
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.16,0:05:17.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,can indeed increase the success rate of refinement.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.84,0:05:20.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Alchemy is to refine the spirit of heaven and earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.44,0:05:23.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now do what's right !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.00,0:05:28.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,This grade 5 pill will shock the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.20,0:05:30.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the future, I will make a grade 6...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.08,0:05:32.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,No, even a grade 7 pill !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.56,0:05:35.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't you want
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.53,0:05:39.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,to follow this old man on this journey ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.35,0:05:44.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are willing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.32,0:05:47.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,The time of Yin has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.32,0:05:47.48,Second,,0,0,0,,Note: Yin = night, Yang = day
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.52,0:05:48.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.76,0:05:50.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,open the furnace !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.72,0:05:57.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Pill Sacrifice !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.24,0:06:05.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's starting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.64,0:06:13.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,First sacrifice, grade 4 Demon Blood Pill !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.20,0:06:46.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's really working !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.60,0:06:49.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,This alchemy technique is really advanced.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.60,0:06:52.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ouyang Zi is an alchemy genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.36,0:06:55.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,He created the Pill Sacrifice method.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.04,0:06:57.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,By sacrificing lower-level pills
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.72,0:07:00.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,it can increase the success rate of refining higher-level pills
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.40,0:07:04.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,Second sacrifice, grade 4 Nature Gathering Pill !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.64,0:07:12.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,Another sacrifice, grade 4 Cloud Stirring Pill !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.44,0:07:15.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Grade 4 Heaven and Earth Pill !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.36,0:07:18.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Golden Clouds Pill !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.24,0:07:43.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior, this is a grade 7 Cyan Cloud Pill !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.69,0:07:50.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,After using the Pill Sacrifice,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.48,0:07:52.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,how can there be so little spiritual energy ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.64,0:07:54.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Forget it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.48,0:07:57.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,even if I need to use the Heaven Stealing Formation,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.44,0:08:00.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will make sure my pill succeeds !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.96,0:08:09.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is bad, they will find the secret room.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.48,0:08:12.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior, don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.44,0:08:14.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wan'er will take care of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.20,0:08:19.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Ancestors ordered...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.08,0:08:20.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will help Senior Ouyang.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.92,0:08:22.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you want to stop me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.28,0:08:51.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,No !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.60,0:08:53.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,This cannot be happening to me !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.40,0:08:56.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will help you, Senior Ouyang.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.84,0:08:58.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's very kind of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.04,0:09:00.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior's cultivation is profound,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.56,0:09:02.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,you should control the flow of spiritual energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.31,0:09:05.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let Junior handle the Heaven Stealing Furnace.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.68,0:09:06.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.36,0:09:11.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,This vortex of energy is extremely violent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.72,0:09:14.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even a Nascent Soul would have trouble absorbing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.80,0:09:17.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,This should compensate how much we are stealing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.84,0:09:40.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've done it !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.68,0:09:50.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,My own grade 5 pill is taking shape !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.52,0:09:52.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.96,0:09:55.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will need to rely on yourself now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.28,0:10:27.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Original body, appear !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.12,0:11:01.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sun Zhenwei ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.32,0:11:11.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,What are you plotting ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.68,0:11:21.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Elder Li, the ceremony is in a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.79,0:11:23.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even without makeup,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.48,0:11:25.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,you need to try your wedding dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.28,0:11:27.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,It will be troublesome if it doesn't fit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.40,0:11:32.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior has been in seclusion for a few days...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.40,0:11:34.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wonder if it's going well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.68,0:11:36.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're so ungrateful !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.60,0:11:39.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't test my patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.32,0:11:47.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,What was your apprentice's name again ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.00,0:11:48.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.04,0:11:50.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Zhou Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.60,0:11:52.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's very loyal to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.61,0:11:53.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,What did you do ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.28,0:11:55.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's not very smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.62,0:11:59.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,That day, your apprentice was acting suspiciously.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.84,0:12:02.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,And you never helped Ouyang Zi before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.42,0:12:05.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,I asked him about it
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.88,0:12:07.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,but he was shameless.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.52,0:12:09.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,He chose death over having his soul searched.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.60,0:12:11.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,So I had to fulfill his wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.92,0:12:15.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,How dare you !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.48,0:12:18.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the Cloud Sky Sect,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.16,0:12:20.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,it doesn't matter if I kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.60,0:12:23.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if I kill you either.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.04,0:12:27.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,I advise you to stay put.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.35,0:12:29.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Whether you obey me or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.48,0:12:32.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,it all depends on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.60,0:12:37.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Teacher troubled you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.04,0:13:03.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Nascent Soul Embryo is forming,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.08,0:13:05.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,I just need to keep injecting spiritual energy into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.68,0:13:15.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Come back !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.21,0:13:23.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Ji Realm is preventing me from reaching Nascent Soul again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.40,0:13:50.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wow, the Cloud Sky Sect is so luxurious !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.48,0:13:53.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,I heard Elder Li is very beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.32,0:13:56.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.24,0:13:57.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.80,0:14:09.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Congratulations !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.12,0:14:13.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Liu, how are you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.58,0:14:17.49,Card Hard,,0,0,0,,{\pos(281,510)\fad(300,000)}Tianyi Zhenren\NLuoyue Sect Leader\NMiddle stage Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.92,0:14:18.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,The number one Sect in the country of Chu
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.16,0:14:20.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,really impresses me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.44,0:14:23.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wonder when we can share our knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.72,0:14:26.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's just a matter of reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.76,0:14:27.20,Card Hard,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1402,531)\fad(300,300)}Liu Fei\NCloud Sky Sect Leader\NMiddle stage Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.27,0:14:29.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,There are hermits with higher cultivation than mine,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.92,0:14:31.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,way more talented than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.84,0:14:37.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,So there are other Ancestors in the Cloud Sky Sect ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.04,0:14:40.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.68,0:14:41.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.68,0:14:47.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.44,0:14:48.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.80,0:14:50.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,Congratulations fellow cultivator Sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.64,0:14:50.52,Second,,0,0,0,,Please come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.68,0:14:53.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Greetings, Tianyi Zhenren.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.72,0:14:55.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is this the groom ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.80,0:14:57.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,You really are Lingwu's son,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.60,0:14:59.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,a handsome talented man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.11,0:15:01.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're flattering me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.08,0:15:07.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.60,0:15:08.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.00,0:15:10.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.00,0:15:10.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.37,0:15:16.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I advise you to be obedient.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.80,0:15:20.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, someone else you know might get hurt again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.08,0:15:23.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Congratulations fellow cultivator Sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.08,0:15:24.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.32,0:15:25.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.80,0:15:26.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,both of you come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.28,0:15:28.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,What an ideal couple !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.96,0:15:30.09,Second,,0,0,0,,Thank you. thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.27,0:15:30.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.72,0:15:37.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivators, long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.92,0:15:39.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,We must drink today to celebrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.20,0:15:43.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's time !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.24,0:15:52.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's really a perfect match.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.32,0:15:54.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,A cultivator with a grade 5 achemist,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.08,0:15:56.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's only a matter of time before he reaches Nascent Soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.32,0:15:58.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,This Zhenwei couple is truly beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.44,0:15:59.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,This kid is lucky !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.92,0:16:03.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,What an ideal couple,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.12,0:16:04.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,they're perfect for each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.84,0:16:14.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today is the day of your Dual Cultivation ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.00,0:16:17.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a happy day for our Cloud Sky Sect !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.16,0:16:21.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wish you two a happy marriage,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.12,0:16:25.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,may you live happily ever after.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.20,0:16:30.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,We cultivators,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.88,0:16:32.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,don't go through every mortal rite.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.76,0:16:35.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,After you drink this cup of wine,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.48,0:16:37.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,consider the ceremony to be complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.00,0:16:44.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't mess with me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.12,0:17:13.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's going on ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.92,0:17:29.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.81,0:17:43.69,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I've had my share of wounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.85,0:17:43.69,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}now I want to fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.77,0:17:47.25,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Is my destiny a wall of restrictions
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.33,0:17:53.17,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}that's blocking all my hopes
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.21,0:17:53.17,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}for life ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.97,0:17:58.93,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}My flesh and blood witnessed the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.69,0:17:58.93,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}my adversity pushed me to brave the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.25,0:18:02.33,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}How do you navigate through the years passing by ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.69,0:18:08.33,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Nirvana and rebirth are no longer
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.41,0:18:08.33,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}out of reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.69,0:18:13.81,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.73,0:18:13.81,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}are obsessed with delusions of grandeur.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.09,0:18:17.85,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Renegades
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.85,0:18:17.85,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}seek to crush the impermanence of the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.85,0:18:21.69,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Don't tell me that I overestimate myself
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.80,0:18:21.69,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}and that the path to revenge leads to hell
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.93,0:18:25.81,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}because I don't see the harm in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.81,0:18:33.61,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}My new body opens its eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.33,0:18:33.61,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}and awakens from its dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.73,0:18:41.17,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}I have overcome many trials
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.85,0:18:41.17,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}to get this body back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.37,0:18:48.81,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}No matter how many endless dark nights go by,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.41,0:18:48.81,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}I can still see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.21,0:18:58.17,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}By sticking to this thought, I will get it done
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.17,0:18:58.17,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}by my own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.61,0:19:19.57,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}Returning to my body opened my eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.33,0:19:19.57,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}I need to continue my Immortal journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.57,0:19:27.13,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}With a flick of a finger,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.01,0:19:27.13,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}only my indomitable heart remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.17,0:19:36.53,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}Life and death trials temper me, I am not afraid of losing my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.13,0:19:36.53,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}Even if there are countless tribulations and hardships.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.77,0:19:44.37,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}Overcome this fate, smash through the obstacles,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.29,0:19:44.37,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}like the descent of a god.
